{title: How Great Thou Art}
{artist: Traditional}
{key: G}
{tempo: 72}
{duration: 5:00}

{start_of_verse}
[G]O Lord my [C]God, when [G]I in awesome wonder
Consider [D]all the [G]worlds Thy hands have made
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Then sings my [C]soul, my [G]Saviour God, to [D]Thee
How great Thou [G]art
{end_of_chorus}
